# Optional: residential proxy URL for transcript/search on Vercel/cloud hosts.
# YOUTUBE_PROXY_URL=http://user:pass@proxy.example.com:8080

# Official YouTube Data API v3 key. Server-side only — read directly by
# server/*.ts via process.env, never bundled into the client (see src/
# for confirmation: no VITE_-prefixed equivalent exists).
# - Optional today: when set, server/search.ts uses it to enrich scraped
#   search results (videos.list/channels.list) with real stats.
# - Required for curated playlists: server/youtubePlaylists.ts (playlistItems.list)
#   has no scraping fallback and returns an error without this key set.
# Get a key: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials (enable
# "YouTube Data API v3" on the project first). Free tier quota is metered
# daily — playlistItems.list costs ~1 unit/call, so this is cheap even at
# moderate traffic, but unlike scraping it does have a hard daily cap.
# YOUTUBE_DATA_API_KEY=your-api-key-here
